This game, its source files, artwork, audio, icons and text are not public
domain and are not open source. This file says what you may do with them
without asking first.


YOU MAY
-------
  - Play the game, at home or anywhere else, for as long as you like, free.
  - Add it to a phone or computer home screen and keep that copy for yourself.
  - Share links to the official copies:
        https://rot-ruin-wbadxv.freebuff.site
        https://dragonmahan-sketch.github.io/rot-and-ruin/
  - Pass the download to a friend exactly as you received it, unmodified, as
    long as you charge nothing for it.
  - Record, stream, screenshot and monetise video of yourself playing it,
    including on YouTube, Twitch and similar, and use the name ROT & RUIN and
    frames from the game to describe that video.
  - Quote short excerpts of the source for review, teaching or commentary.


YOU MAY NOT
-----------
  - Redistribute modified copies, or publish the game's source under another
    name or as part of another product.
  - Sell the game, the files, or access to them; put them behind a paywall or
    an ad-gated download; or bundle them into something you sell.
  - Use the name ROT & RUIN, its logo or its artwork for a different game or
    product, or in any way that suggests this project endorses it.
  - Re-upload the files to an app store, a game store, a package registry or a
    web host you control as a copy of this game.
  - Claim authorship of the game or of its art.


THE CO-OP ROOM SERVER
---------------------
server.js, room.js and sim.js in coop/ are included so you can run a room for
yourself and your friends. Running one privately is fine. Hosting it publicly,
with or without payment, is not.


NO WARRANTY
